  "mermaid": "graph TD\n    %% Precursor from Shikimate\n    A(\\1) --> B[Shikimate Pathway Product]\n    B --> C[TrpE/D Anthranilate Synthase]\n    \n    %% Step 1: Anthranilate Formation\n    C --> D{AND: Chorismate + Gln<br/>AND TrpE/D?}\n    D -->|No| E[\\Synthesis Blocked/]\n    D -->|Yes| F[TrpE Amidotransferase]\n    F --> G[Glutamine \u2192 Glutamate + NH3]\n    G --> H[NH3 Attacks Chorismate]\n    H --> I[Anthranilate Formation]\n    I --> J[Pyruvate Released]\n    \n    %% Step 2: Phosphoribosylation\n    I --> K[TrpD Phosphoribosyltransferase]\n    K --> L{AND: Anthranilate + PRPP<br/>AND TrpD?}\n    L -->|No| E\n    L -->|Yes| M[PRPP Transfer]\n    M --> N[N-5'-Phosphoribosyl-anthranilate]\n    N --> O[PPi Released]\n    \n    %% Step 3: Isomerization\n    N --> P[TrpF Phosphoribosylanthranilate Isomerase]\n    P --> Q[Amadori Rearrangement]\n    Q --> R[1-O-Carboxyphenylamino-1-deoxyribulose-5-P]\n    R --> S(\\1)\n    \n    %% Step 4: Indole-Glycerol-P Formation\n    S --> T[TrpC Indole-3-Glycerol-P Synthase]\n    T --> U[Ring Closure + Decarboxylation]\n    U --> V[Indole-3-Glycerol Phosphate]\n    V --> W[CO2 Released]\n    \n    %% Step 5: Tryptophan Synthase\n    V --> X[TrpA/B Tryptophan Synthase]\n    X --> Y{AND: TrpA \u03b1-Subunit<br/>AND TrpB \u03b2-Subunit?}\n    Y -->|No| E\n    Y -->|Yes| Z[\u03b12\u03b22 Tetramer]\n    \n    %% TrpA Reaction\n    Z --> AA[\"TrpA: IGP \u2192 Indole + G3P\"]\n    AA --> AB[Indole Intermediate]\n    AB --> AC[Indole Channeled to TrpB]\n    \n    %% TrpB Reaction  \n    AC --> AD[\"TrpB: Serine Dehydration\"]\n    AD --> AE[/Serine + PLP \u2192 Aminoacrylate/]\n    AE --> AF[Indole + Aminoacrylate]\n    AF --> AG[C-C Bond Formation]\n    AG --> AH(\\1)\n    AH --> AI[PLP Regenerated]\n    \n    %% Regulation - TrpR Repressor\n    AH --> AJ[Tryptophan Accumulation]\n    AJ --> AK{OR: Trp<br/>Level?}\n    AK -->|High| AL[Trp Binds TrpR]\n    AK -->|Low| AM[\\TrpR Inactive/]\n    \n    AL --> AN[TrpR-Trp Complex]\n    AN --> AO[TrpR Binds trp Operator]\n    AO --> AP[/trp Operon Repression/]\n    AP --> AQ[/No Transcription/]\n    \n    AM --> AR[/No Repression/]\n    AR --> AS[trp Operon Transcription]\n    AS --> AT[TrpEDCBA mRNA]\n    AT --> AU[Enzyme Synthesis]\n    AU --> C\n    \n    %% Attenuation Control\n    AS --> AV[trpL Leader Sequence]\n    AV --> AW{OR: Trp-tRNA<br/>Charged?}\n    AW -->|Yes - High Trp| AX[Ribosome Fast Through Leader]\n    AW -->|No - Low Trp| AY[Ribosome Stalls at Trp Codons]\n    \n    AX --> AZ[\"Stem-Loop 3:4 Forms\"]\n    AZ --> BA[/Terminator Hairpin/]\n    BA --> BB[/Transcription Terminated/]\n    BB --> AQ\n    \n    AY --> BC[\"Stem-Loop 2:3 Forms\"]\n    BC --> BD[/Antiterminator/]\n    BD --> BE[Transcription Continues]\n    BE --> AT\n    \n    %% Tryptophan Utilization\n    AH --> BF{OR: Trp<br/>Fate?}\n    BF -->|Protein Synthesis| BG[tRNA-Trp Charging]\n    BF -->|Biosynthesis| BH[NAD+ Synthesis via Kynurenine]\n    BF -->|Secondary Metabolite| BI[Indole Production]\n    \n    BG --> BJ(\\1)\n    BH --> BK[NAD+ Cofactor]\n    BI --> BL[Indole Signaling]\n    \n    BJ --> BM((\\1))\n    BK --> BN((\\1))\n    BL --> BO([Quorum Sensing])\n    \n    E --> BP([Tryptophan Starvation])\n    AQ --> BP\n    \n    %% Styling\n\n    %% Semantic Color Styling\n\n    %% Semantic Color Styling\n\n    %% Semantic Color Styling\n\n    %% Semantic Color Styling\n    style A fill:#51cf66,color:#fff\n    style B fill:#51cf66,color:#fff\n    style C fill:#51cf66,color:#fff\n    style D fill:#7950f2,color:#fff\n    style E fill:#e74c3c,color:#fff\n    style F fill:#42a5f5,color:#fff\n    style G fill:#b3e5fc,color:#000\n    style H fill:#b3e5fc,color:#000\n    style I fill:#b3e5fc,color:#000\n    style J fill:#b3e5fc,color:#000\n    style K fill:#42a5f5,color:#fff\n    style L fill:#7950f2,color:#fff\n    style M fill:#b3e5fc,color:#000\n    style N fill:#b3e5fc,color:#000\n    style O fill:#b3e5fc,color:#000\n    style P fill:#42a5f5,color:#fff\